*** Settings ***
Documentation       Business actions in the settings app - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/mobile_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Start Settings App
    [Documentation]    Starts the settings app.
    Launch App

Open Setting
    [Documentation]    Opens an entry of the settings, e.g. "Display" or "Battery".
    [Arguments]    ${entry}
    ${selector}    Build Mobile Selector    ${ANDROID_SETTINGS_ENTRY}    ${entry}
    Tap On    ${selector}

Stop App
    [Documentation]    Closes the app.
    Close Apps
